PROJECT "EYE OF THE MOON" - EXECUTION TIMELINE
CLASSIFIED. LEADER AND MASKED HANDLER ONLY. DESTROY AFTER READING.

Phase 1 - Acquisition: seal all nine tailed beasts into the Gedo Statue. (In progress;
seven of nine secured.)

Phase 2 - Revival: with all nine beasts sealed, restore the Statue to its true form -
the Ten-Tails, the primordial beast from which all others were divided.

Phase 3 - Reintegration: the Ten-Tails' jinchuriki channels its power to cast the
Infinite Tsukuyomi across the world, its reflection thrown from the eye of the moon.

Phase 4 - The Dream: every living soul falls under a single, inescapable genjutsu.
No war, no want, no defiance. The Dawn's peace, made permanent.

The membership at large understands only Phase 1. The remainder is the handler's alone.
Nagato believes this brings peace. Let him.
